    {
      "id": "3299b609-c435-4d22-89bd-a5c80038edb4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute e leia a frase. O foco aqui é retomar o arrependimento antes da forma mais precisa desta aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a59c7bf6-edb6-4a65-b5ce-4836674f708f",
          "textContent": "<p>Uma profissional percebe tarde demais que abriu uma mensagem falsa no trabalho.</p><p><strong>Debería haber revisado el remitente del mensaje.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu deveria ter conferido o remetente da mensagem.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d54348c4b0334e0cba6207c44e91d648_b01-alerta-correo-y-arrepentimiento.png?Expires=1794099819&Signature=C2SQQiFCqRIuhDiqTijddzIjWF0mQNZWXp6O-i~jU4EeSgxJedhjOAtHU3lI~H6HxQJ5SImbHGPqj3XRE5SLLTrTPZFA9M77EgzDGrGnTsCUS7wjQQTSdoeIQ936BCrJNXSJ2hlCRr5vkuEJRnHv4ejbigwl9D2fNmF1ZplsxjmQfBxsAqS9pkUSkg2EPlXqmnV0Va0UeofphxelYxQDWvTrfeybwIcPle5Y~p2v62PSg-pk5yxeIs9wkuFj8fdpuRIqoKnUyNMV3Nw228DzOPLB5HNzEpR9CesIn0Y3dVsczRhsuzvF6N7DNkdET37eFjqhzkU2ClFGbNk3IRbeTw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/95f6e1878f174b8487450a0331f2e8ae_b01-deberia-haber-revisado-el-remitente.mp3?Expires=1794099819&Signature=CZMrXd3AxhM2jXmAAYgNMPdlYTKN5hQNjzsxcLqNJfEQLyXz8JazWJsCG7tDAdCxUOo1BG~b65UAvaptwGT8RZ~SZlm92pBB2nJ3wY~xCMf2c-IJeTj3D41oGWtU~ZDKWrDvwAhu3QD6xSEHJazRlv0G-RpEhGByp69TUfMLdE0-kWn5neV-GzJuTb2gXEoBXnfELC8DJBiJ5j2xCNRaEWxUEUwvnayEw0nS5GO64P6b0DEPx~5pueFgW0n6UC1FJ0jw068j7d8w0pRdjOQ~63koqmwumPudKR0Xu~1liRmZcYCki2Z5YJHWa6tsjm9DkSLADVrxUw~CLkeZ-tI9TQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
